{"4996850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Beatlash: Survival","steam_appid":4996850,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horde survivor that plays around the music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE YOUR OWN MUSIC<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load any song off your drive and it becomes the battlefield.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/87e2e27d511b4e34df9366696cf53e72.poster.avif?t=1793721725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/87e2e27d511b4e34df9366696cf53e72.webm?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/87e2e27d511b4e34df9366696cf53e72.mp4?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > THE WORLD MOVES TO THE MUSIC<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05c2a28d728f135704680e02da2a774d.poster.avif?t=1793721725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05c2a28d728f135704680e02da2a774d.webm?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05c2a28d728f135704680e02da2a774d.mp4?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horde walks in on the beat. Your guns answer on the beat. The floor, the lights, the whole ruined city pulses along with it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stop watching the screen and start listening to the fight.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND THEN THE DROP HITS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/08be9b82e8da4ebaf1c38c05edef3d4a.poster.avif?t=1793721725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/08be9b82e8da4ebaf1c38c05edef3d4a.webm?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/08be9b82e8da4ebaf1c38c05edef3d4a.mp4?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been holding it. The build climbs, the enemies keep coming, you're one hit from gone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the beat lands and you land with it, and everything in front of you turns to light.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's the whole game. Chasing that moment, over and over.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY IT YOUR WAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05d7cdfd76a4451d00cd80cbdf558607.poster.avif?t=1793721725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05d7cdfd76a4451d00cd80cbdf558607.webm?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05d7cdfd76a4451d00cd80cbdf558607.mp4?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon has its own pulse. Some hammer constantly, some wait and hit like a truck. Pick your weapons and what comes out of it is a rhythm nobody else is playing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, you get a choice. Then another. Then another. By the end of a good run you've built something ridiculous and you know exactly how you got there.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your headphones. Feel the beat. Survive.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horde survivor that plays around the music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE YOUR OWN MUSIC<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load any song off your drive and it becomes the battlefield.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/87e2e27d511b4e34df9366696cf53e72.poster.avif?t=1793721725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/87e2e27d511b4e34df9366696cf53e72.webm?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/87e2e27d511b4e34df9366696cf53e72.mp4?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > THE WORLD MOVES TO THE MUSIC<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05c2a28d728f135704680e02da2a774d.poster.avif?t=1793721725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05c2a28d728f135704680e02da2a774d.webm?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05c2a28d728f135704680e02da2a774d.mp4?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horde walks in on the beat. Your guns answer on the beat. The floor, the lights, the whole ruined city pulses along with it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You stop watching the screen and start listening to the fight.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND THEN THE DROP HITS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/08be9b82e8da4ebaf1c38c05edef3d4a.poster.avif?t=1793721725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/08be9b82e8da4ebaf1c38c05edef3d4a.webm?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/08be9b82e8da4ebaf1c38c05edef3d4a.mp4?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been holding it. The build climbs, the enemies keep coming, you're one hit from gone.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then the beat lands and you land with it, and everything in front of you turns to light.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's the whole game. Chasing that moment, over and over.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY IT YOUR WAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05d7cdfd76a4451d00cd80cbdf558607.poster.avif?t=1793721725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05d7cdfd76a4451d00cd80cbdf558607.webm?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/extras\/05d7cdfd76a4451d00cd80cbdf558607.mp4?t=1793721725\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon has its own pulse. Some hammer constantly, some wait and hit like a truck. Pick your weapons and what comes out of it is a rhythm nobody else is playing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, you get a choice. Then another. Then another. By the end of a good run you've built something ridiculous and you know exactly how you got there.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your headphones. Feel the beat. Survive.<\/p>","short_description":"A horde survivor that plays your music. Thousands of enemies, all moving to the beat, and when the drop hits, so do you. Put on your favourite song and watch the whole screen come apart in time with it.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/9ac06e848e0ff6eb44647622d737ce079925dbb3\/header.jpg?t=1793721725","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/28b8807c0d81a6a2f6acd3b284cd2f89ff0218d3\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793721725","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4996850\/28b8807c0d81a6a2f6acd3b284cd2f89ff0218d3\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793721725","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD 630 \/ NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD RX 550 (1 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/stro